41425::$$$message_0296_0000_0000$$$::"This is Lancer's Personal Outfit (Left) that you see him in all over town, as well as his part-time work outfit. [cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01d(中) textoff=0]He had the most variations, not counting the female cast."::
41426::$$$message_0296_0001_0000$$$::"Apron (Right) was unfortunately cut from the game.[br]He was supposed to wear it at the stuffed animal shop."::
41427::$$$message_0296_0002_0000$$$::"The waiter outfit in the middle...[cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01f(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01f(中)][shock vmax=20 time=250 count=4] Is that a new class!?[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01l(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01l(中)] That's how good it looks on him.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01m(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=600][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01m(中)][move textoff=0 time=200 path=(442,44,255)(454,44,255)(427,44,255)(454,44,255) storage=凛巫女服01m(中) accel=-2][wm canskip=0] You work hard too, hear me?"::
41428::$$$message_0296_0003_0000$$$::"I'm not competing with a fishmonger."::
41429::$$$message_0296_0004_0000$$$::"Feeesh?"::
